    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0012:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0012",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "When creating an instance you add media subtype FourCC codes as `NSNumber` objects to the `subtypes` array to elect to receive that type as a [`CMSampleBuffer`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMSampleBuffer) instead of an attributed string.",
      "normalizedSource": "When creating an instance you add media subtype FourCC codes as `NSNumber` objects to the `subtypes` array to elect to receive that type as a [`CMSampleBuffer`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMSampleBuffer) instead of an attributed string.",
      "sourceHash": "842e6276bba890e79864abb6feed0c6d2dcc34cab3de068db50547bee642afe3",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "FourCC codes are converted to `NSNumber` objects as shown:",
      "documentTitle": "init(mediaSubtypesForNativeRepresentation:)",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "ko": "인스턴스를 생성할 때 미디어 서브타입 FourCC 코드를 `NSNumber` 객체로 `subtypes` 배열에 추가하면 해당 유형을 [`CMSampleBuffer`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMSampleBuffer)에서 문자열 속성으로 처리하지 않고 `CMSampleBuffer`로 수신하도록 지정할 수 있습니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
