      "preserveReason": "code",
      "contextBefore": "FourCC codes are converted to `NSNumber` objects as shown:",
      "contextAfter": "Initializing an `AVPlayerItemLegibleOutput` using the `init` method (which is preferred) is equivalent to calling this method with an empty `subtypes` array, which means that all legible data, regardless of media subtype, is delivered using [`NSAttributedString`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSAttributedString) instances in a common format.",
