    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0014:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0014",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "Initializing an `AVPlayerItemLegibleOutput` using the `init` method (which is preferred) is equivalent to calling this method with an empty `subtypes` array, which means that all legible data, regardless of media subtype, is delivered using [`NSAttributedString`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSAttributedString) instances in a common format.",
      "normalizedSource": "Initializing an `AVPlayerItemLegibleOutput` using the `init` method (which is preferred) is equivalent to calling this method with an empty `subtypes` array, which means that all legible data, regardless of media subtype, is delivered using [`NSAttributedString`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSAttributedString) instances in a common format.",
      "sourceHash": "f8d82328df3b291ccf3051868c5ea415060633216c56b816d1d235096a06ede4",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "```objc\n@[ [NSNumber numberWithUnsignedInt:'tx3g'] ]\n```",
      "contextAfter": "If a media subtype for which there is no legible data in the current player item is included in the media `subtypes` array, no error occurs.",
      "documentTitle": "init(mediaSubtypesForNativeRepresentation:)",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "ko": "`init` 메서드(권장)를 사용해 `AVPlayerItemLegibleOutput`를 초기화하면 빈 `subtypes` 배열로 이 메서드를 호출한 것과 동일하며, 이는 미디어 서브타입에 관계없이 모든 legible 데이터가 공통 형식의 [`NSAttributedString`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSAttributedString) 인스턴스로 전달됨을 의미합니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
      "translatedAt": "2026-05-12T15:21:31.659Z",
      "translator": "codex-cli-oauth"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0015:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0015",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "If a media subtype for which there is no legible data in the current player item is included in the media `subtypes` array, no error occurs.",
      "normalizedSource": "If a media subtype for which there is no legible data in the current player item is included in the media `subtypes` array, no error occurs.",
      "sourceHash": "12b3b1ff168c1e12fba21be3f3fc0f5c0baca2bcb51fe7f65d4dd0b58d0ac911",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Initializing an `AVPlayerItemLegibleOutput` using the `init` method (which is preferred) is equivalent to calling this method with an empty `subtypes` array, which means that all legible data, regardless of media subtype, is delivered using [`NSAttributedString`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Foundation/NSAttributedString) instances in a common format.",
      "contextAfter": "An `AVPlayerItemLegibleOutput` instance doesn’t vend closed caption data as a [`CMSampleBuffer`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMSampleBuffer), so it is an error to include `'c608'` in the media subtypes array.",
      "documentTitle": "init(mediaSubtypesForNativeRepresentation:)",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "ko": "현재 player item에 legible 데이터가 없는 미디어 서브타입이 media `subtypes` 배열에 포함되어 있어도 오류가 발생하지 않습니다.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
      "translatedAt": "2026-05-12T15:21:31.659Z",
      "translator": "codex-cli-oauth"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0015:0002",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0015",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "An `AVPlayerItemLegibleOutput` instance doesn’t vend closed caption data as a [`CMSampleBuffer`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMSampleBuffer), so it is an error to include `'c608'` in the media subtypes array.",
      "normalizedSource": "An `AVPlayerItemLegibleOutput` instance doesn’t vend closed caption data as a [`CMSampleBuffer`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMSampleBuffer), so it is an error to include `'c608'` in the media subtypes array.",
      "sourceHash": "52b2f2c931eea72b1f98ec3216f6e5fe5a4f2b7a330b837743e039a08e37497d",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "If a media subtype for which there is no legible data in the current player item is included in the media `subtypes` array, no error occurs.",
      "contextAfter": "**Note**: The preferred method of creating an `AVPlayerItemLegibleOutput` object is to use the [`init`](1805461-init.md) method.",
      "documentTitle": "init(mediaSubtypesForNativeRepresentation:)",
      "framework": "AVFoundation",
      "ko": "An `AVPlayerItemLegibleOutput` instance doesn’t vend closed caption data as a [`CMSampleBuffer`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMSampleBuffer), so it is an error to include `'c608'` in the media subtypes array.",
      "status": "machine_translated",
      "reviewed": false,
      "locked": false,
      "translatedAt": "2026-05-12T15:21:31.659Z",
      "translator": "codex-cli-oauth"
